# Talking to a resident or a wanderer (week 30).
# Everything in {{ }} and every "do ..." / "[if ... /]" comes from the
# conversation's Talk object (src/dialogue/talk.gd): the words that depend on
# the world are made there, the shape of the conversation is here.

~ start
{{npc}}: {{greeting}}
if recognized
	{{npc}}: {{recognition}}
if offers_bribe
	=> guarded
if hostile
	=> END
=> menu

~ guarded
{{npc}}: {{halt_text}}
- Offer {{bribe_cost}} ichor to look away. [if can_bribe /]
	do bribe()
	{{npc}}: {{bribe_text}}
	=> END
- Talk instead. [if not hostile /]
	=> menu
- Leave.
	=> END

~ menu
- What news?
	{{npc}}: {{rumor()}}
	=> menu
- Tell me about your people.
	{{npc}}: {{creed}}
	=> menu
- Trade? [if can_trade /]
	{{npc}}: {{offer_text}}
	if has_payment
		- Deal.
			do trade()
			{{npc}}: {{trade_done_text}}
		- Not now.
	=> menu
- The heart-key. [if key_here /]
	=> key
- Farewell.
	{{npc}}: {{farewell}}
	=> END

~ key
{{npc}}: {{key_line}}
- Give it to me. The heart is calling. [if can_ask_key /]
	do ask_key()
	{{npc}}: {{key_text}}
	=> menu
- I will pay {{key_price}} ichor for it. [if can_buy_key /]
	do buy_key()
	{{npc}}: {{key_text}}
	=> menu
- Never mind.
	=> menu
